# The notification relay: a blind courier between a self-hosted Custos instance and
# APNs. It speaks one iroh ALPN (`ezpds/notify/0`), stores opaque push handles, and —
# from the next phase — forwards HPKE-sealed payloads to Apple. It never sees plaintext
# and holds no key material belonging to an instance or a device.
